<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 423)</h2>
<p><b>Film Lab fixed, and two review-room papercuts.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Film Lab looks are right again.</b> The engine was baking LUTs that expected a different color space than the app fed them — every look landed skewed. The contract is now explicit end to end; black-and-white stocks are actually monochrome and print stocks read like prints. Update the Film Lab engine when prompted.</li>
<li>Double-clicking the (invisible) title-bar strip now zooms the window, per system convention.</li>
<li>While comparing, the notes composer shows an amber strip naming exactly which clip your note will land on — no more notes on the wrong version.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
