<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 419)</h2>
<p><b>Set the camera gate once, for every shot.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Measure From now works in two scopes: <b>All Shots</b> sets the gate for the whole session, <b>This Shot</b> overrides one clip (by hand or Auto-Detect). Overrides win, both save with the session, and pipeline-stamped shots keep their own gate.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
